", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE05bDdFejB1Ym1nM2M2dWkyQ1NFbk5JUkMtOUxKTG9wMVlpa0lDcE1vbm1odzdHbVMzQlA1Ym1uZWlJQ0JlVXppN3JRRml5V3BVWUFEZF8yZFVRcDhUYkt2a3ZtcERsTko1Q2M1ZVk2bmd2Nzg4OGR1MTVBN29MQQ?oc=5"}], "model": {"prior_margin": -8.35, "prior_sd": 5.0, "poll_margin": -26.65, "poll_sd": 6.2, "poll_weight": 0.39, "fundamentals": {"margin": -2.61, "lean": -10.0, "environment": 7.65, "incumbency": 0.0, "money": -0.26}, "rating_margin": -12.18, "sigma_race": 6.0, "sigma_total": 6.53, "baseline_margin": -15.58, "analyst_adjustment": -4.42, "key_factors": ["Consistent October polling shows Alme leading Bankhead by 22-28 points in an R+10 open seat", "Bankhead is damaged by the drop-out job offer allegation and a reported gaffe, while Buttigieg's endorsement of independent Bodnar splits the anti-Republican vote", "All eleven expert ratings call the race Safe/Solid or Likely R, and markets price a Democratic win near zero", "Alme holds a large fundraising edge over Bankhead, though Bodnar's $4.9M haul adds three-way uncertainty"], "rationale": "Every recent poll, regardless of sponsor, shows the Republican ahead by more than twenty points, and raters and prediction markets agree the seat is out of reach for Democrats. The Democratic nominee's self-inflicted wounds and a well-funded independent bid further fragment the opposition in a state that already leans Republican by ten points.", "watch": "Whether Seth Bodnar's independent campaign consolidates enough anti-partisan voters to compress Alme's margin or, in a extreme scenario, put an unusual three-way finish in play.", "confidence": "high", "notes": ["Open seat: Steve Daines (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Montana's open Senate seat, vacated by retiring Republican Steve Daines, sits in a state that leans Republican by ten points. Polling throughout the fall has consistently shown Republican Kurt Alme leading Democratic nominee Alani Bankhead by roughly twenty points or more, with recent surveys putting the gap between twenty-two and twenty-eight points. Independent Seth Bodnar, endorsed by Pete Buttigieg, has raised the most money of any candidate and appears positioned to take a meaningful share of the vote.\n\nBankhead's campaign has been overshadowed by her claim that national Democrats offered her a job to exit the race, along with a report about remarks regarding Native Americans. Analysts across the spectrum rate the race Safe or Likely Republican, and prediction markets give Democrats almost no chance. The main open question is the size of Alme's winning margin and how much support Bodnar consolidates.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0053, "margin": -15.34}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0066, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0028, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.004, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0021, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0024, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0027, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0026, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0029, "margin": -19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0019, "margin": -22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.004, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0025, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0084, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0014, "margin": -22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0022, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0026, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0037, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0022, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0019, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0021, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0029, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0024, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0029, "margin": -20.0}, {"date": "202